      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type of the field or throws an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a> if no field could be found.",
      "translation": "返回该字段的类型；如果找不到任何字段，则抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the detected field.",
      "translation": "返回检测到的字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the field that was detected.",
      "translation": "返回检测到的字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type of the field.",
      "translation": "返回字段的类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieves the value of the field by reflection.",
      "translation": "通过反射获取字段的值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - in case no field with the configured annotation was found.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果未找到带有配置的注解的字段。</dd>",
      "count": 2
    },
